#: comea_app/utils.py:23 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:150
msgid ""
"The map is not yet a concept map; it is a block of text with scattered "
"lines. There are no linking words, and the nodes contain long explanations. "
"The concept map is abscent of the desired attribute (conceptual structure)."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:24 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:159
msgid ""
"The student begins to use short concepts, but most connections still lack "
"linking words. The structure is still linear. The concept map is an initial "
"approach, but far from ideal."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:25 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:168
msgid ""
"Concepts now predominate over long texts. Linking words are present, with "
"less than half missing. There is little branching. The concept map meets the "
"minimum, but is inconsistent."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:26 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:177
msgid ""
"The map is free of long texts. All linking words are present. Branching is "
"noticeable (3–4 points), but hierarchical depth is still limited (< 3 "
"levels). The concept map presents a functional structure, although not very "
"deep."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:27 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:186
msgid ""
"The map meets the criteria of level 3, but now with high branching (5–6 "
"points) and developed hierarchy (≥ 3 levels). Still no cross-links. The "
"concept map presents a solid structure, but without integration between "
"branches."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:28 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:195
msgid ""
"Everything level 4 offers, plus 1 to 2 cross-links. The student can now "
"establish relationships between different parts of the map. The concept map "
"presents a robust structure with evidence of relational thinking."
msgstr ""

#: comea_app/utils.py:29 comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:204
msgid ""
"Maximum level. It presents very high branching (≥ 7 points), developed "
"hierarchy, and multiple cross-links (> 2). Indicates high capacity for "
"conceptual integration and differentiation. The concept map presents a full "
"mastery of the tool and knowledge structuring."
msgstr ""

