#: comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:33
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "What is it?"

#: comea_theme/templates/concept_map.html:35
msgid ""
"The Topological Taxonomy is a classification tool developed by the Conéctate "
"al Conocimiento Project in Panama to assess the structural complexity of "
"concept maps. It consists of 7 levels (0 to 6) that analyze the external "
"structure of the map, not its semantic content. It is inspired by Bloom's "
"Taxonomy and aims to provide a 'common language' to describe the evolution "
"of students' concept maps."
msgstr ""

